# The shared CI package `@smotastic/pocket-ci` comes from the Gitea npm registry (ADR 0012). Its
# token is no repository file: CI sets it from the REGISTRY_TOKEN secret, a developer once with
# `pnpm config set //mac-mini-von-nils.local:3000/api/packages/smotastic/npm/:_authToken <token>`.
@smotastic:registry=http://mac-mini-von-nils.local:3000/api/packages/smotastic/npm/
